{"text": "Rikki broke two more eggs and ran to the veranda with the last one in his mouth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Teddy and his parents were sitting at the breakfast table, but they were not eating. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They sat as still as stones, because Nagaina was coiled up near Teddys leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Son of the big man who killed Nag, stay still, she said, I am not ready yet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Turn round, Nagaina, Turn and fight, cried Rikki, holding up the egg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Nagaina saw her last egg, she turned away from Teddy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At that moment, Teddys father reached out and pulled his son to safety. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was I who caught Nag in the bathroom, said Rikki proudly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nagaina grabbed the egg and raced like an arrow to her hole, and Rikki followed her inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Darzee thought that Rikki was dead, but soon Rikki came out, covered in dirt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is all over, he said, The widow will never come out again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From then on, Rikki guarded the garden, and no cobra ever dared to come inside its walls.", "alignment": {"characters": ["R", "i", "k", "k", "i", " ", "b", "r", "o", "k", "e", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "m", "o", "r", "e", " ", "e", "g", "g", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "r", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "v", "e", "r", "a", "n", "d", "a", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "m", "o", "u", "t", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "e", "d", "d", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "p", "a", "r", "e", "n", "t", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", "f", "a", "s", "t", " ", "t", "a", "b", 